    <briefdescription>
<para>Obstacle representation for branch nodes in a spatial tree. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class aggregates obstacle information from child terrain cells of a branch terrain cell. It provides flags for full obstacles and partial obstacles and calculates the patch priority for updates. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
